    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJ9yAEcq6nHrqUJzgajT3N9AgK7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>过去的一个月又是心力交瘁的30天，跟大家汇报一下这个月发生的趣事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>原本打算尝试挑战制作一期付费节目进行更新，但录了半小时感觉情绪down下去了，并且内容丰富程度和我之前预想的也有差距，觉得不太好意思收费于是就还是照常发布了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外一会儿咱们把上期节目的奖抽了，被抽到的朋友微信喊我一声，谢谢。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 挨砸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 急救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 怪癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 打针</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 追凶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 物业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 唠嗑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Mr. Big - To Be With You</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Marcin - Carmen</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
